# Recorded responses from real external services (spec 0004). A recording is
# evidence: it exists to be byte for byte what the service actually sent.
# .lintstagedrc.json runs `prettier --write` on every staged *.json and
# `pnpm format:check` runs in CI, so without this a recording would be rewritten
# on commit and would fail the check until it was, and the one property the
# store exists to hold would be gone.
